Author: 3DS Recorder

Version:
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # 0 = any title (the recorder names the game in user_param.bin)

Title: 3DS Recorder launcher

Summary: Starts the 3DS Recorder module again after an extended-memory game rebooted an Old 3DS

Description: |
  Loaded once, only when the recorder asked Rosalina for it right before the reboot.
  It starts the recorder module and returns; no menu, no threads.

Compatibility: Console

MemorySize: 2MiB

EventsSelfManaged: true

UsePrivateMemory: false
